WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.329 --> 00:00:05.457
Today’s task: make ten flats, then regroup them into a cube.

2
00:00:05.457 --> 00:00:07.881
Drag a flat from the palette into the Hundreds column.

3
00:00:07.881 --> 00:00:17.078
Each tap adds one more to the same column.

4
00:00:17.078 --> 00:00:21.135
Tap a flat, then Regroup: ten flats make one cube.

5
00:00:21.135 --> 00:00:25.729
Hold the cube and pick Break. The total stays 1,000.

6
00:00:25.729 --> 00:00:28.077
Drag across the column to select all ten flats.

7
00:00:28.077 --> 00:00:30.998
Drag them into Thousands, and they trade for a cube.

8
00:00:30.998 --> 00:00:36.442
Number set switches the palette to decimal blocks.

9
00:00:36.442 --> 00:00:44.726
Every task has its prompt and a teacher note, below the board.
